      <description>
        
          
          
          
        
        
        
          &lt;p&gt;Here is another of many JavaScript based image carousels, I had seen many similar to these made in SilverLight and Flash, I came across a wonderful &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.shinedraw.com/animation-effect/flash-vs-silverlight-image-carousel/&#34;&gt;carousel&lt;/a&gt; made in SilverLight some time back which was very fluid in behavior and could easily be customized and configured to take various shape and form.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1314/resources/carousel.png&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1314/resources/carousel_thumb.png&#34; alt=&#34;carousel&#34; title=&#34;carousel&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I have managed to port it to JavaScript, it works best on chrome or FF, hope this would be fun to play with.&lt;/p&gt;
          
        
        </description>
